- [x] **A2: constants equal certified report.** Tests read clearance-v4 `report.json` and check all represented shaper dimensions, holder pairs, signed ratio, stroke limits, overtravel and backoff; hob dimensions, lead, starts/module, centre distance, and numerically parsed infeed/retract path. Collar width 3 mm and arbor length 12 mm are specified by the leaf, and explicitly tested as such; the report does not supply those two keys. Floating-point comparisons accommodate the report's binary-decimal serialization residue.
